#: src/cli/completions.md:1
msgid "The completions command"
msgstr "补全命令"

#: src/cli/completions.md:3
msgid ""
"The completions command is used to generate auto-completions for some common "
"shells. This means when you type `mdbook` in your shell, you can then press "
"your shell's auto-complete key (usually the Tab key) and it may display what "
"the valid options are, or finish partial input."
msgstr ""
"Completions命令用于为一些常见的shell生成自动补全功能。这意味着，当您在shell中"
"输入`mdbook`时，可以按下shell的自动补全键（通常是Tab键），系统可能会显示可用"
"的选项，或者完成部分输入。"

#: src/cli/completions.md:6
msgid "The completions first need to be installed for your shell:"
msgstr "首先，需要为你的shell安装这些补全工具："

#: src/cli/completions.md:9
msgid "# bash\n"
msgstr "# bash\n"

#: src/cli/completions.md:10
msgid "# oh-my-zsh\n"
msgstr "# oh-my-zsh\n"

#: src/cli/completions.md:16
msgid ""
"The command prints a completion script for the given shell. Run `mdbook "
"completions --help` for a list of supported shells."
msgstr ""
"该命令会为给定的shell环境打印出补全脚本。如需查看支持的shell列表，请运行 "
"`mdbook completions --help`。"

#: src/cli/completions.md:19
msgid ""
"Where to place the completions depend on which shell you are using and your "
"operating system. Consult your shell's documentation for more information "
"one where to place the script."
msgstr ""
"放置补全信息的位置取决于你使用的shell以及你的操作系统。如需更多信息，请查阅你"
"所使用的shell的相关文档，了解如何正确地放置脚本。"
